{"version":1,"content":"<p>10月18日凌晨3時許，演員吳越在社交平台發文表示，一覺醒來，竟發現有人利用AI技術冒充自己行騙，痛批相關行為「太惡劣」，並要求涉嫌詐騙者將騙取的款項如數退還。</p><p>目前，該賬號在微信視頻號上已不可查。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T12:38:37.044100+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T12:06:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T14:58:15.671127+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T12:37:33.724061+00:00","content_hash":"ec367a757dd5dd2c167135b713d61cd4660ea844f39268d05985c01fa0b9b2fc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}